    "rust_model": [
      "render_no_oracle now keeps the same-rank constraint for LEFT/RIGHT notes and calls LayoutGraph::add_edge_with_minlen for every attached note.",
      "deployment_attached_note_minlen maps LEFT/RIGHT to 0 and TOP/BOTTOM to 1, matching the cited Java LinkArg length minus one."
